{title: Long Live Cow Girls 3/4-scow}
{artist: Ian Munsick & Cody Johnson}
{key: G}
{comment: Chart adapted from chord sheet — verify arrangement}
{comment: 3/4 scow feel}
{comment: Structure: I V C S V C T}

{start_of_intro}
| [Em] | [Cadd9] | [G] | [D] | [Em] | [Cadd9] | [G] | [D] |
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse}
[G]She's a gooseneck on a dually, a [Cadd9]long neck at the bar
[D]Loves old John Wayne movies, [G]waltzing under them stars
[G]She's sun up in the saddle, [Cadd9]cutting through the herd
[D]Loves branding her cattle, [G]long live cowgirls
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Em]Well, she rode in them wagons when the [Cadd9]Wild West was won
[G]Took the canyons and badlands and [D]made 'em her home
[G]She's boots on, LeDoux songs, [Am]snaps on her pearls
[Cadd9]Long [D]live [Em]cowgirls
| [Cadd9] | [G] | [D] |
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_instrumental}
| [Em] | [Cadd9] | [G] | [D] |
{end_of_instrumental}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Like a paint-colored mustang, she's [Cadd9]fast and she's wild
[D]Stop a runaway freight train with her [G]high country smile
[G]She's tough as December, [Cadd9]salt of the earth
[D]Make ya fall like September, [G]long live cowgirls
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Em]Well, she rode in them wagons when the [Cadd9]Wild West was won
[G]Took the canyons and badlands and [D]made 'em her home
[G]She's boots on, Chris LeDoux songs, [Am]snaps on her pearls
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_tag}
[G]She's been there and she'll be here till the [Am]end of the world
[Cadd9]Long [D]live [Em]cowgirls
| [Cadd9] | [G] | [D] | [G] |
{end_of_tag}
